Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.25,0:00:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Marblehead, keep a hand on\Nyour
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.41,0:00:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,hat today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.11,0:00:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Saturday October 17th looks\Nlike a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.65,0:00:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,nice Preston Beach morning,\Nespecially
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.97,0:00:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,from 7:30 AM to 11:30 AM
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.69,0:00:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,for a low-tide walk and a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.01,0:00:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,poke around the tide pools.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.81,0:00:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s around 50 degrees and\Ncloudy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.01,0:00:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,with an 18 mph breeze, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.57,0:00:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,that wind may reach 20 mph,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.93,0:00:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,so paddleboards deserve a\Nlittle extra
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.35,0:00:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.55,0:00:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Low tide is 10:16 AM, with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.13,0:00:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,highs at 4:23 AM and 4:32
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,PM.
